                    <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-emerald-400 font-medium px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 mt-2 transition-all duration-500" id="impact-status-tag">Mitigating Variables...</span>
